</figure>

## Live components

A component block, with a blank line inside it:

<Stack orientation="horizontal" gap={4}>
  <Button on:click={() => count++}>Increment</Button>

  <Button kind="ghost" on:click={() => (count = 0)}>Reset</Button>
</Stack>

{#if count > 0}
<p>Clicked {count} {count === 1 ? "time" : "times"}.</p>
{/if}

A ComboBox with state, a callback prop, and a typed event. Hover anything in the code. The JS view types it with JSDoc; switch to TS for the same types as annotations.

<ComboBox
  labelText="Region"
  placeholder="Choose a region"
  items={regions}
  bind:selectedId
  shouldFilterItem={filterRegions}
  on:select={handleSelect}
  on:clear={() => (status = "")}
/>
<p>{status || `Selected: ${selected?.text ?? "none"}`}</p>

A prop that isn't in the component's API, passed through to the element:

<Button kind="tertiary" icon={Add} tooltip="Add a region" on:click={(event) => (count += event.shiftKey ? 10 : 1)}>Add region ({count})</Button>

Components inline in copy: the build is <Tag size="sm" type="green">passing</Tag> and the deploy is running.

<InlineLoading description="Deploying…" />

